        airports=['Ashgabat International Airport (ASB - architectural marvel shaped like a giant white falcon, home of Turkmenistan Airlines)', 'Türkmenbaşy International Airport (KRW)', 'Türkmenabat International Airport (CRZ)', 'Mary International Airport (MYP)', 'Daşoguz Airport (TAZ)'],
