        religions=['Islam ~99.1% (predominantly Sunni Shafi\'i ~65% in the south, coastal Tihamah, and lower highlands; Zaydi Shia ~35% in the northern highlands)', 'Tiny historic indigenous Jewish community (virtually all emigrated to Israel; fewer than a dozen individuals remain)', 'Christian, Hindu, and Baha\'i minorities <0.9%'],
